{"code":0,"data":{"title":"小游戏标签题材指南","content":"<table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"123\" style=\"width: 123px\"><p><strong>一级标签</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"136\" style=\"width: 136px\"><p><strong>二级标签</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"144\" style=\"width: 144px\"><p><strong>三级标签</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"887\" style=\"width: 887px\"><p><strong>标签释义</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"67\" colwidth=\"123\" style=\"width: 123px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>题材</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"24\" colwidth=\"136\" style=\"width: 136px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>通用题材</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"144\" style=\"width: 144px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>恋爱</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"887\" style=\"width: 887px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>模拟约会或恋爱的经历过程</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"144\" style=\"width: 144px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>生存</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"887\" style=\"width: 887px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>游戏具备生存系统（口渴值、饱食度、感染度等）或拟真肢体伤害</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"144\" style=\"width: 144px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>烹饪</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"887\" style=\"width: 887px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>模拟饭菜或饮料类的烹制过程（纯餐厅经营类不打烹饪标签）</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"144\" style=\"width: 144px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>逃生</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"887\" style=\"width: 887px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>逃生背景题材或模拟逃生过程</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"144\" style=\"width: 144px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>音乐节奏</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"887\" style=\"width: 887px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>固定谱面，根据音乐或节奏进行节拍打击的游戏</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"144\" style=\"width: 144px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>恐怖</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"887\" style=\"width: 887px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>游戏刻意渲染恐怖氛围，使玩家形成紧张及恐惧感，标志性要素：僵尸、鬼</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"144\" style=\"width: 144px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>恶搞</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"887\" style=\"width: 887px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>游戏内容以滑稽、无厘头的搞笑手法解构常识性事件</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"144\" style=\"width: 144px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>魔性</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"887\" style=\"width: 887px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>游戏玩法内容古怪又不乏趣味</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"144\" style=\"width: 144px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>减压</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"887\" style=\"width: 887px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>游戏玩法内容有助于玩家缓解、释放压力</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"144\" style=\"width: 144px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>高自由度</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"887\" style=\"width: 887px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>用户可自由支配的游戏内容丰富程度</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"144\" style=\"width: 144px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>虐心</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"887\" style=\"width: 887px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>游戏玩法难度较高或剧情内容具备虐感易于引起玩家不适</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"144\" style=\"width: 144px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>鬼畜</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"887\" style=\"width: 887px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>以画面和声音重复率高为主要特点，兼具强烈的节奏感和喜感效果</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"144\" style=\"width: 144px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>温馨治愈</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"887\" style=\"width: 887px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>游戏玩法内容有助于玩家感觉轻松舒畅、抚慰心灵</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"144\" style=\"width: 144px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>狩猎</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"887\" style=\"width: 887px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>狩猎背景题材或模拟狩猎过程</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"144\" style=\"width: 144px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>餐厨</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"887\" style=\"width: 887px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>餐厅/厨房背景题材游戏</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"144\" style=\"width: 144px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>手工</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"887\" style=\"width: 887px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>模拟手工制作道具的过程</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"144\" style=\"width: 144px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>手残勿点</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"887\" style=\"width: 887px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>考验玩家反应力或操作手法，具备难度门槛，多为轻度内容游戏</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"144\" style=\"width: 144px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>破坏</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"887\" style=\"width: 887px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>模拟物体或建筑类的毁灭、破坏过程</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"144\" style=\"width: 144px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>割草</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"887\" style=\"width: 887px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>敌方单位数量多且密集，攻击消灭敌人如同割草</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"144\" style=\"width: 144px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>美少女</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"887\" style=\"width: 887px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>游戏以美少女角色作为主要卖点且具备市场认可度</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"144\" style=\"width: 144px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>学园</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"887\" style=\"width: 887px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>校园/学院背景题材游戏</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"144\" style=\"width: 144px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>二次元</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"887\" style=\"width: 887px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>1.二次元审美风格<br>2.具备厨力活跃/付费基础</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"144\" style=\"width: 144px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>偶像</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"887\" style=\"width: 887px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>娱乐圈背景题材或模拟偶像养成</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"144\" style=\"width: 144px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>魔法少女</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"887\" style=\"width: 887px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>魔法少女题材</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"34\" colwidth=\"136\" style=\"width: 136px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>精确IP</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"144\" style=\"width: 144px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>葫芦娃</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"19\" colwidth=\"887\" style=\"width: 887px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>/</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"144\" style=\"width: 144px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>猪猪侠</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"144\" style=\"width: 144px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>熊出没</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"144\" style=\"width: 144px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>赛尔号</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"144\" style=\"width: 144px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p><strong>果宝